silm:instances_papers_04_forge_chapters_01_gate_discipline_sections_03_arrow_typing_contract_yoneda_hom_leg_2 silm:hasExample "In 'YonedaHomLeg — 03_arrow_typing_contract #2', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, Every cited info object interprets some local content — the vet record interprets as 'body mass 4.2 kg'." .
